<p>Dear administrator,</p>

<p>The refresh job for <%= @searcher %> just failed to run with an error.</p>

<p>This could indicate a temporary service outage, an update to the website, or a change in how data is organized within the remote database file.</p>

<p>If this error persists for this website, please make sure a developer takes the time to look into the exact cause.</p>

<% if @e %>
  <% if @e&.message.present? %>
    <p> Exception Message: <%= @e&.message %> </p>
  <% end %>
  <% if @e&.backtrace.present? %>
    <p> Exception backtrace: <%= @e&.backtrace %> </p>
  <% end %>
<% end %>